# AV safety evaluation (synthetic 2-D robot, see README)

Scenario coverage: 30/30 matrix cells x 5 estimators x 20 seeds = 3000 episodes. Fault active at the closest obstacle approach in 68.9% of faulted episodes. Cells with any EKF collision: ekf 26, ekf_monitor 19 of 30. Wall time 167s with 3 workers.

Localization errors compare the updated estimate and truth at the same simulator time. NEES summaries are equal-weight means of per-episode summaries; the exceedance column averages each episode's sampled exceedance fraction.

